* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode R
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
* REXDO--C       EXECUTE COMMIT PF-KEY IN DEFINITION PROGRAMS
*
* MAINTENANCE:
*
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
DECIDE ON FIRST VALUE OF G-PF-FUNC
*
   VALUE ##PFK-EXIT
                      RESET G-HOLD-TIME
                      G-NATRP-ERC
                      G-NATRP-ERT
                      END TRANSACTION
                      ESCAPE ROUTINE
*
   VALUE ##PFK-COMMIT
                      END TRANSACTION
                      RESET G-HOLD-TIME
                      MOVE 0015 TO G-NATRP-ERC
                      MOVE 'M' TO #FUNC G-C-FUNC
                      MOVE FALSE TO G-COMMIT
                      ESCAPE BOTTOM (FIND-LOOP.)
*
   NONE VALUE         IGNORE
*
END-DECIDE
